* P0 demo behavioural part models (ideal; spike only)
* Inductor with series DCR: L (H), R (ohm)
.subckt IND_DCR a b L=120u R=3
L1 a m {L}
R1 m b {R}
.ends IND_DCR
* Ideal op-amp as VCVS (gain 1e5, zero output impedance); rails only loaded by 1 Gohm
.subckt OPA_IDEAL inp inn out vcc vee
E1 out 0 inp inn 1e5
Rvcc vcc 0 1e9
Rvee vee 0 1e9
.ends OPA_IDEAL
